GL-ProteinFormer model
To address the characteristics of the small-scale IHC_2021 dataset (limited samples and reduced image dimensions), GL-ProteinFormer enhances ProteinFormer through a dual optimization strategy: (1) employing a lightweight Swin-Transformer backbone to reduce parameters. (2) incorporating residual attention and convolutional enhancement modules to mitigate overfitting risks. The overall architecture is depicted in Fig.
2
.
